Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Add explicit local and cloud execution profiles

Reason: Keep one FineSub engine bundle while making cloud-only behavior an
explicit call-site choice. Local remains the default profile.
Removal: Delete this patch after upstream provides an equivalent execution
profile contract and Finoka has migrated its local and cloud adapters.

